process state and twinapi.appcore app state. Left out: the Proton media-converter rank (not in this tree)
and the debugging aids (TLS-callback tracing, WINE_IMAGE_PATCH in-memory byte patching, illegal-
instruction byte dumps), none of which a game needs to run.
